WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.217
Here is how to use Wall Ball Judge.

2
00:00:04.117 --> 00:00:05.638
You can use it in two ways.

3
00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:09.392
Replay a video of a set, or count a set live, with the camera.

4
00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:13.212
To replay a set, tap Replay a video, then pick your video.

5
00:00:14.212 --> 00:00:17.312
The app looks for the target, and puts a box on each plate.

6
00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:21.170
Upper is selected, so the ball must reach the upper target.

7
00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:22.889
Tap Start the set.

8
00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:24.928
Now it checks every rep.

9
00:00:26.905 --> 00:00:29.496
A good rep counts, and the target turns green.

10
00:00:30.603 --> 00:00:32.281
That squat stayed above parallel.

11
00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:33.337
No rep.

12
00:00:35.705 --> 00:00:36.735
Another good rep.

13
00:00:40.019 --> 00:00:42.030
That ball hit only the lower target.

14
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.866
This athlete needs the upper one, so no rep.

15
00:00:45.486 --> 00:00:48.124
When the video ends, the count stays on the screen.

16
00:00:49.024 --> 00:00:53.239
For a live set, stand the phone beside or behind the athlete, at hip height.

17
00:00:53.859 --> 00:00:56.567
Make sure it sees the hips, the knees, and the target.

18
00:00:57.187 --> 00:00:59.500
Don’t put it near the wall, or under the target.

19
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:01.211
Then tap Set up.

20
00:01:01.531 --> 00:01:04.165
The camera opens, and the app looks for the target.

21
00:01:04.785 --> 00:01:06.802
At a new gym, it may find nothing.

22
00:01:07.122 --> 00:01:08.844
Tap each plate to add a box.

23
00:01:09.464 --> 00:01:11.965
Drag each corner to fit the box to its plate.

24
00:01:12.585 --> 00:01:13.980
A box in the wrong place?

25
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.786
Tap its × to remove it.

26
00:01:16.406 --> 00:01:17.183
Tap Lower.

27
00:01:17.503 --> 00:01:19.694
This athlete throws to the lower target.

28
00:01:20.314 --> 00:01:21.646
Then tap Start the set.

29
00:01:25.793 --> 00:01:27.882
You hear the count after each good rep.

30
00:01:33.891 --> 00:01:34.833
Above parallel.

31
00:01:35.153 --> 00:01:36.646
No rep, and a low buzz.

32
00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:38.665
Tap Stop to end the set.

33
00:01:38.985 --> 00:01:40.892
The count stays until you tap Reset.

34
00:01:41.892 --> 00:01:43.932
Try it now at wallballs.app.
